{"id":"07dcb8bee101c949","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-purelyquadratic.md","title":"Purely quadratic Boolean functions","display":"df-purelyquadratic — Purely quadratic Boolean functions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-purelyquadratic","aliases":["27-df-purelyquadratic"],"display":"df-purelyquadratic — Purely quadratic Boolean functions","depends_on":["[[27-df-quadfunc]]","[[27-df-piset]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§5.1 Definition 5.4","source_statement":"Purely quadratic Boolean functions","source_printed_pages":"204","source_pdf_pages":"228","verification_status":"source-definition-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-purelyquadratic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-purelyquadratic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-purelyquadratic — Purely quadratic Boolean functions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"923be44c9742df37\" href=\"?note=923be44c9742df37\" title=\"27-df-quadfunc\">27-df-quadfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.1 Definition 5.4"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"07dcb8bee101c949\" href=\"?note=07dcb8bee101c949\" title=\"Purely quadratic Boolean functions\">Purely quadratic Boolean functions</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"204"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"228"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lits}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lits}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"923be44c9742df37\" href=\"?note=923be44c9742df37\" title=\"27-df-quadfunc\">27-df-quadfunc</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PureQuad}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n\\mid (\\exists a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=0\\land f(b)=1))\\land\\forall T\\in\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\;(|\\mathrm{Lits}(T)|\\neq1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PureQuad}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n\\mid (\\exists a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=0\\land f(b)=1))\\land\\forall T\\in\\mathrm{PI}(f)\\;(|\\mathrm{Lits}(T)|\\neq1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本书 purely quadratic 同时排除两个常函数和一次素项；二次的含义仍是 DNF 项长度。n≤1 时此类为空。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-quadfunc","status":"resolv