:"1ad4ae22be339cdc","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PureQuad}_n$，$\\mathrm{PI}$、$\\mathrm{Lits}$ 取 [[27-df-purelyquadratic]] 的含义；$\\mathrm{Dual}_n$ 见 [[27-df-dual]]。$\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n$ 是 [[27-df-literal]] 中正式定义的一致文字集族。"}],"outgoing":["923be44c9742df37","3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2"]}